'''Caches of runes''' can be obtained from the [[Chest (Tombs of Amascut)|reward chest]] within the [[Tombs of Amascut]]. It can be opened to receive runes. Based on the value of the runes, the value of the cache can range from {{NoCoins|{{Min|{{GEP|Death rune|500}}|{{GEP|Blood rune|500}}|{{GEP|Soul rune|500}}}}|c}} to {{NoCoins|{{Max|{{GEP|Death rune|3000}}|{{GEP|Blood rune|3000}}|{{GEP|Soul rune|3000}}}}|c}} each. 

==Rewards==
Raid factors such as raid level or contribution points have no effect on the roll, thus all cache rolls use the probabilities as described below. The average quantity of runes is 1,125.

